<p>
  The offset is computed by the adaptation / long-term inheritance (LTI) logic
  and stored per plate. It compensates for systematic model errors, limit avoidance,
  or thermal crown effects. The header bar shows <code>offset4InternalTarget</code>,
  <code>targetPrOffset</code> (from LTI), and <code>targetCrKink</code>.
</p>

